<tr><td>slip / slipender</td><td>sleep</td></tr>
<tr><td>empty / emting</td><td>mt (static Thread reference)</td></tr>
<tr><td>intraption / entrap</td><td>interrupt</td></tr>
<tr><td>atimata / attima</td><td>immediately</td></tr>
<tr><td>throsa / through ski</td><td>throws</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Thread</th><th>Responsibility</th></tr>
<tr><td>Main</td><td>Runs the for loop in main, prints &quot;Main Thread&quot;</td></tr>
<tr><td>Child</td><td>Calls mt.join() → enters waiting state until main finishes</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Thread</th><th>Action</th></tr>
<tr><td>Main</td><td>t.join() → waits for child to complete</td></tr>
<tr><td>Child</td><td>mt.join() → waits for main to complete</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Question</th><th>Answer</th></tr>
<tr><td>How many threads?</td><td>1 — main only</td></tr>
<tr><td>Who executes join()?</td><td>Main thread</td></tr>
<tr><td>Thread.currentThread() means?</td><td>Main thread</td></tr>
<tr><td>Meaning?</td><td>Main wants to wait until itself completes</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Case</th><th>Description</th><th>Result</th></tr>
<tr><td>1 (prev video)</td><td>Main joins child</td><td>Main waits for child</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td>Child joins main (via static mt)</td><td>Child waits for main</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td>Both join each other</td><td>Deadlock</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td>Thread joins itself</td><td>Deadlock</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Overload</th><th>Native?</th><th>Parameters</th></tr>
<tr><td>sleep(long millis)</td><td>Yes (JNI)</td><td>milliseconds only</td></tr>
<tr><td>sleep(long millis, int nanos)</td><td>No (Java impl)</td><td>milliseconds + nanoseconds</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Option</th><th>Condition</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td>Time expires — sleep duration elapses</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td>Interrupted — sleeping thread receives interrupt</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Target state</th><th>Can interrupt?</th></tr>
<tr><td>Sleeping thread</td><td>Yes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Waiting thread (e.g. blocked on join)</td><td>Yes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Running (not sleeping/waiting)</td><td>Special behavior (see loophole)</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Line</th><th>Executed by</th><th>Effect</th></tr>
<tr><td>t.start()</td><td>Main</td><td>Starts child</td></tr>
<tr><td>t.interrupt()</td><td>Main</td><td>Sends interrupt to child</td></tr>
<tr><td>Child in sleep(2000)</td><td>Child</td><td>Receives interrupt → InterruptedException</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>t.interrupt()</th><th>Child iterations</th><th>Catch executed?</th></tr>
<tr><td>Active</td><td>1</td><td>Yes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Commented</td><td>10</td><td>No</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Option</th><th>Correct?</th></tr>
<tr><td>Exception thrown immediately</td><td>No</td></tr>
<tr><td>Interrupt call wasted immediately</td><td>No (not immediately)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Interrupt call waits</td><td>Yes</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>When to use</th></tr>
<tr><td>yield()</td><td>Thread wants to pass execution to give chance to remaining waiting threads of same priority</td></tr>
<tr><td>join()</td><td>Thread wants to wait until completing some other thread</td></tr>
<tr><td>sleep()</td><td>Thread does not want to perform any operation for a particular amount of time</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Overloaded?</th></tr>
<tr><td>yield</td><td>No (only one form)</td></tr>
<tr><td>join</td><td>Yes (3 forms: no-arg, millis, millis+nanos)</td></tr>
<tr><td>sleep</td><td>Yes (2 forms)</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>final?</th></tr>
<tr><td>yield</td><td>No</td></tr>
<tr><td>join</td><td>Yes — every join method is final</td></tr>
<tr><td>sleep</td><td>No</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Throws IE?</th></tr>
<tr><td>yield</td><td>No</td></tr>
<tr><td>join</td><td>Yes</td></tr>
<tr><td>sleep</td><td>Yes</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Native?</th></tr>
<tr><td>yield</td><td>Yes</td></tr>
<tr><td>join</td><td>No (all implemented in Java)</td></tr>
<tr><td>sleep(long)</td><td>Yes</td></tr>
<tr><td>sleep(long, int)</td><td>No</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Static?</th></tr>
<tr><td>yield</td><td>Yes — Thread.yield()</td></tr>
<tr><td>join</td><td>No — instance method: t.join()</td></tr>
<tr><td>sleep</td><td>Yes — Thread.sleep()</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>#</th><th>Class</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td>MyThread (Case 2)</td><td>Static mt + child joins main</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td>ThreadJoinDemo1</td><td>Assign main ref, demo Case 2</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td>ThreadJoinDemo3</td><td>Mutual join deadlock</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td>Test (Case 4)</td><td>Self-join deadlock</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td>SlideRotator</td><td>sleep() demo</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td>MyThread (lazy)</td><td>Interrupt during sleep</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td>ThreadInterruptDemo</td><td>Main interrupts child</td></tr>
<tr><td>8</td><td>MyThread (10K loop)</td><td>Deferred interrupt</td></tr>
<tr><td>9</td><td>ThreadSleepDemo1</td><td>Full deferred interrupt demo</td></tr>
</table>
</body></html>
